.'=>'發生錯誤。','Auto Terms Existing Content'=>'自動術語現有內容','This feature can scan your existing content and automatically assign new and existing terms.'=>'此功能可以掃描您現有的內容，並自動分配新的和現有的術語。','Select an option...'=>'選擇一個選項...','Auto Terms setting'=>'自動術語設定','Select an Auto Terms configuration to use when scanning content.'=>'選擇一個自動術語配置以在掃描內容時使用。','This enables you to add Terms to existing content in batches. If you have a lot of existing content, set this to a lower number to avoid timeouts.'=>'這使您能夠批量將術語新增至現有內容。如果您有大量現有內容，請將此設置為較低的數字以避免超時。','This setting allows you to add Terms only to recent content.'=>'此設置允許您僅將術語新增至最近的內容。','Save Settings'=>'儲存設定','Results'=>'結果','You can see full log details on the %1s screen'=>'您可以在 %1s 螢幕上查看完整的日誌詳細資訊','Tag Cloud'=>'標籤雲','Tags Cloud'=>'標籤雲','Select all terms'=>'選擇所有術語','Name'=>'名稱','Slug'=>'Slug','Count'=>'計數','No term avaliable.'=>'沒有可用的術語。','Select term %s'=>'選擇術語 %s','Taxonomies'=>'taxonomies','Registration key'=>'註冊金鑰','Description'=>'描述','Active'=>'啟用','Order'=>'訂單','Edited'=>'已編輯','No taxonomies found.'=>'未找到分類法。','View'=>'檢視','WordPress core'=>'WordPress 核心','PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies','A readable CSV stream is required.'=>'需要可讀的 CSV 流。','The CSV file could not be read.'=>'無法讀取 CSV 檔案。','The CSV file exceeds the 5 MiB import limit.'=>'CSV 檔案超過了 5 MiB 的匯入限制。','CSV record 1 contains invalid TaxoPress transfer metadata.'=>'CSV 紀錄 1 包含無效的 TaxoPress 傳輸元資料。','This CSV was exported for taxonomy "%1$s" and post type "%2$s". Change the selection to match before importing.'=>'此 CSV 為分類法 "%1$s" 和文章類型 "%2$s" 匯出。請更改選擇以匹配後再匯入。','CSV record %d must contain slug,name,description and may also contain post_ids or parent_slug,post_ids.'=>'CSV 紀錄 %d 必須包含 slug、name、description，並且可能還包含 post_ids 或 parent_slug、post_ids。','Column count must match the header exactly.'=>'欄位數量必須與標頭完全匹配。','CSV records cannot contain more than five columns.'=>'CSV 紀錄不能包含超過五個欄位。','The CSV file exceeds the 5,000-term import limit.'=>'CSV 檔案超過了 5,000 個術語的匯入限制。','Malformed CSV quoting.'=>'格式不正確的 CSV 引號。','Unclosed quoted CSV field.'=>'未關閉的引號 CSV 欄位。','Import requires an array of no more than 5,000 terms.'=>'匯入需要不超過 5,000 個術語的數組。','Each term must have string slug, name, and description fields.'=>'每個術語必須具有字符串 slug、name 和 description 欄位。','Fields must contain valid UTF-8 without null bytes.'=>'欄位必須包含有效的 UTF-8，且不得有空字元。','Name and slug must be nonempty and usable.'=>'名稱和 slug 必須為非空且可用。','Name and slug must each be at most 200 bytes; values are not truncated.'=>'名稱和 slug 每個最多為 200 個字元；值不會被截斷。','Description must be at most 10,000 bytes.'=>'描述必須最多為 10,000 字元。','Slug must already be a canonical WordPress slug and cannot be "0".'=>'Slug 必須已經是標準的 WordPress slug，且不能是 "0"。','Duplicate slug; first used in CSV record %d.'=>'重複的 slug；首次在 CSV 記錄 %d 中使用。','parent_slug must be a string.'=>'parent_slug 必須是字串。','parent_slug can only be used with a hierarchical taxonomy.'=>'parent_slug 只能與階層式 taxonomy 一起使用。','parent_slug must be a different canonical WordPress slug.'=>'parent_slug 必須是不同的標準 WordPress slug。','parent_slug must identify a term in this CSV file or an existing term in the selected taxonomy.'=>'parent_slug 必須識別此 CSV 文件中的一個術語或所選 taxonomy 中的現有術語。','Term parent relationships cannot contain a cycle.'=>'術語父關係不能包含循環。','You do not have permission to assign terms in the selected taxonomy. No terms or assignments were written.'=>'您沒有權限在所選 taxonomy 中分配術語。未寫入任何術語或分配。','The file exceeds the 25,000 term-to-content assignment import limit.'=>'文件超過 25,000 個術語到內容分配的導入限制。','You do not have permission to edit content ID %d. No terms or assignments were written.'=>'您沒有權限編輯內容 ID %d。未寫入任何術語或分配。','The selected taxonomy is unavailable.'=>'所選的 taxonomy 不可用。','The selected post type is unavailable or does not support the selected taxonomy.'=>'所選的 post type 不可用或不支援所選的 taxonomy。','post_ids must be a pipe-delimited string of positive integer IDs.'=>'post_ids 必須是以管道分隔的正整數 ID 字串。','Too many or oversized post IDs.'=>'帖子 ID 太多或超出大小。','Post IDs must be canonical positive decimal integers within the PHP integer range (no spaces, signs, leading zeros, or empty IDs).'=>'帖子 ID 必須是標準的正十進制整數，且在 PHP 整數範圍內（無空格、符號、前導零或空 ID）。','Duplicate post ID within this term record.'=>'此術語記錄中存在重複的帖子 ID。','The parent term could not be found after processing its CSV record.'=>'在處理其 CSV 記錄後找不到父術語。','Some content assignments were skipped because the content was missing or incompatible. All valid terms and assignments were still imported.'=>'某些內容分配被跳過，因為內容缺失或不兼容。所有有效的術語和分配仍然被導入。','The assignment could not be verified after saving.'=>'保存後無法驗證分配。','Assignment to content ID %1$d failed: %2$s'=>'內容 ID %1$d 的分配失敗：%2$s','A writable CSV stream is required.'=>'需要可寫的 CSV 流。','The CSV output could not be written.'=>'無法寫入 CSV 輸出。','A term could not be read during export. Please try again.'=>'在導出期間無法讀取術語。請重試。','You cannot read every associated content item. Export was cancelled without downloading a partial file.'=>'您無法讀取每個關聯的內容項目。導出已取消，未下載部分文件。','A parent term could not be read during export. Please try again.'=>'在導出期間無法讀取父術語。請重試。','CSV record %1$d: %2$s'=>'CSV 記錄 %1$d：%2$s','You do not have permission to transfer terms for this taxonomy and post type.'=>'您沒有權限轉移此 taxonomy 和 post type 的術語。','A POST request is required.'=>'需要一個 POST 請求。','A temporary export file could not be created.'=>'無法創建臨時導出文件。','The export file could not be rewound.'=>'無法重繞導出文件。','An output buffer prevented a clean CSV download.'=>'輸出緩衝區阻止了乾淨的 CSV 下載。','Output was sent before the download. Check other plugins and retry.'=>'在下載之前已發送輸出。檢查其他插件並重試。','Upload failed. Choose a CSV file and check the server upload limit.'=>'上傳失敗。選擇一個 CSV 文件並檢查伺服器上傳限制。','Choose a genuine uploaded file with a .csv extension.'=>'選擇一個真正的上傳文件，並且具有 .csv 擴展名。','The CSV file could not be read or exceeds the 5 MiB import limit.'=>'無法讀取 CSV 文件或超出 5 MiB 的導入限制。','The uploaded CSV file could not be opened.'=>'上傳的 CSV 文件無法打開。','The term export failed.'=>'術語導出失敗。','The term import failed. No changes were made.'=>'術語導入失敗。未做出任何更改。','The term import finished with errors. Some changes may have been applied.'=>'術語導入以錯誤結束。可能已應用某些更改。','The terms were imported, with some content assignments skipped.'=>'術語已被導入，但某些內容分配被跳過。','The terms were imported successfully.'=>'術語已成功導入。','Created: %1$d. Updated: %2$d. Skipped: %3$d. Errors: %4$d.'=>'已創建：%1$d。已更新：%2$d。已跳過：%3$d。錯誤：%4$d。','Assignments added: %1$d. Assignments unchanged: %2$d.'=>'已添加的分配：%1$d。未更改的分配：%2$d。','Content assignments skipped: %1$d because %2$d content items were missing or incompatible.'=>'內容分配已跳過：%1$d，因為有 %2$d 個內容項目缺失或不兼容。','Error details (up to the first 100):'=>'錯誤詳情（最多顯示前 100 條）：','Export Terms'=>'導出術語','Export all %1$s terms and their %2$s assignments to a CSV file. Unused terms and term hierarchy are included.'=>'將所有 %1$s 術語及其 %2$s 分配導出到 CSV 文件。未使用的術語和術語層級也包括在內。','Import Terms'=>'導入術語','Import %s terms from a CSV file created by this tool. Existing terms are matched by slug, and assignments are added without removing other terms.'=>'從此工具創建的 CSV 文件中導入 %s 術語。現有術語通過 slug 進行匹配，並在不刪除其他術語的情況下添加分配。','Back up your site first. Content IDs must identify the same content on both sites. There is no automatic rollback.'=>'請先備份您的網站。內容 ID 必須在兩個網站上標識相同的內容。沒有自動回滾。','CSV file:'=>'CSV 文件：','Update the name, description, and parent of existing terms.'=>'更新現有術語的名稱、描述和父級。','Skip missing or incompatible content assignments.'=>'跳過缺失或不兼容的內容分配。','Maximum file size: 5 MiB, 5,000 terms, and 25,000 content assignments.'=>'最大文件大小：5 MiB，5,000 個術語和 25,000 個內容分配。','You can export these terms, but you do not have permission to import them.'=>'您可以導出這些術語，但無權導入它們。','Separate tags with commas'=>'用逗號分隔標籤','Run Auto Terms'=>'運行自動術語','Auto Terms configuration'=>'自動術語配置','Select at least one post first.'=>'請先選擇至少一個帖子。','Posts processed: %1$d of %2$d.'=>'已處理的帖子：%1$d 之 %2$d。','Finished. Posts processed: %1$d. Posts with terms added: %2$d. Check Auto Terms Logs for details.'=>'完成。已處理的帖子：%1$d。已添加術語的帖子：%2$d。請檢查自動術語日誌以獲取詳細信息。','Auto Terms stopped. The request failed; previously completed posts were not rolled back.'=>'自動術語已停止。請求失敗；先前已完成的帖子未被回滾。','You cannot run Auto Terms on this post.'=>'您無法在此帖子上運行自動術語。','This post cannot be processed.'=>'此帖子無法被處理。','This Auto Terms configuration is disabled or unavailable for this post.'=>'此自動術語配置已禁用或對此帖子不可用。','This post status is not enabled in the Auto Terms configuration.'=>'此帖子狀態在自動術語配置中未啟用。','Auto Terms is already processing this post. Please retry later.'=>'自動術語已在處理此帖子。請稍後重試。','Auto Terms could not process this post. Check Auto Terms Logs for details.'=>'自動術語無法處理此帖子。請檢查自動術語日誌以獲取詳細信息。','Counter'=>'計數器','Random'=>'隨機','Method for choosing terms'=>'選擇術語的方法','Ascending'=>'升序','Descending'=>'降序','Ordering for choosing terms'=>'選擇術語的排序','Maximum terms'=>'最大術語數量','Start typing to search'=>'開始輸入以搜索','Edit this metabox'=>'編輯此元框','Click to display tags'=>'點擊顯示標籤','suggested terms'=>'建議的術語','Click terms to add them to this %s'=>'點擊術語將其添加到此 %s','Search terms'=>'搜索術語','Show existing terms'=>'顯示現有術語','Security check failed.'=>'安全檢查失敗。','No terms in your WordPress database.'=>'您的 WordPress 資料庫中沒有術語。','No results from your WordPress database.'=>'您的 WordPress 資料庫中沒有結果。','PublishPress Taxonomies: Manage Terms'=>'PublishPress 稅onomies：管理術語','Manage Terms'=>'管理術語','Permission denied!'=>'權限被拒絕！','Security problem. Try again.'=>'安全問題。請再試一次。','Missing valid taxonomy for work. Try again.'=>'缺少有效的 taxonomy 以進行工作。請再試一次。','This feature allows you to import and export terms, and manage your content terms by adding, renaming, merging and deleting unused terms.'=>'此功能允許您匯入和匯出術語，並透過新增、重新命名、合併和刪除未使用的術語來管理您的內容術語。','Import / Export'=>'匯入 / 匯出','Add Terms'=>'新增術語','Remove Terms'=>'移除術語','Rename Terms'=>'重新命名術語','Merge Terms'=>'合併術語','Delete Rarely Used Terms'=>'刪除很少使用的術語','Manage Terms tools'=>'管理術語工具','Assign one or more terms to content.'=>'將一個或多個術語指派給內容。','Apply to'=>'應用於','All %s'=>'所有 %s','Only content assigned to specific terms'=>'僅限指派給特定術語的內容','Only update content assigned to any of these terms'=>'僅更新指派給這些術語的任何內容','Separate multiple terms with commas.'=>'用逗號分隔多個術語。','Terms to add'=>'要新增的術語','Enter one or more comma-separated terms.'=>'輸入一個或多個以逗號分隔的術語。','Remove term assignments from content without deleting the terms.'=>'從內容中移除術語指派，而不刪除這些術語。','Terms to remove'=>'要移除的術語','The terms remain available after their assignments are removed.'=>'術語在其指派被移除後仍然可用。','Change term names without changing their content assignments.'=>'更改術語名稱而不更改其內容指派。','Current term names'=>'當前術語名稱','New term names'=>'新術語名稱','Enter comma-separated names in matching order.'=>'以對應順序輸入以逗號分隔的名稱。','Move content assignments to one destination term and delete the source terms.'=>'將內容指派移動到一個目標術語並刪除來源術語。','Source terms are permanently deleted after their assignments are moved.'=>'來源術語在其指派被移動後將被永久刪除。','Merge method'=>'合併方法','Merge terms with different names'=>'合併具有不同名稱的術語','Merge duplicate terms with the same name'=>'合併具有相同名稱的重複術語','Source terms to merge'=>'要合併的來源術語','Enter two or more comma-separated terms.'=>'輸入兩個或更多以逗號分隔的術語。','Destination term'=>'目標術語','Content assigned to the source terms will be reassigned to this term.'=>'指派給來源術語的內容將被重新指派給此術語。','Suggest Terms to Merge'=>'建議合併的術語','Delete terms used fewer than the selected number of times.'=>'刪除使用次數少於所選次數的術語。','Check how many terms will be affected before deleting. This action cannot be undone.'=>'在刪除之前檢查將受影響的術語數量。此操作無法撤銷。','Delete terms used fewer than'=>'刪除使用次數少於','times'=>'次數','Check Affected Terms'=>'檢查受影響的術語','Delete Terms'=>'刪除術語','Multiple merge suggestions selected'=>'選擇了多個合併建議','You have selected multiple merge suggestions. All selected terms will be merged into a single new term.'=>'您已選擇多個合併建議。所有選定的術語將合併為一個新的術語。','Cancel'=>'取消','Continue'=>'繼續','Permission denied for this taxonomy.'=>'此 taxonomy 的權限被拒絕。','No terms provided for merging!'=>'未提供要合併的術語！','No terms with the same name found.'=>'未找到相同名稱的術語。','Merged term(s) with the same name "%s". %d posts updated.'=>'合併的術語與相同名稱 "%s"。 %d 篇文章已更新。','No new term specified!'=>'未指定新的術語！','No new/old valid term specified!'=>'未指定新的/舊