(預設：22)','Unit font size:'=>'單位字體大小：','Point (default)'=>'點 (預設)','Pixel'=>'像素','Em'=>'em','Pourcent'=>'百分比','Format:'=>'格式：','Flat (default)'=>'扁平 (預設)','List (UL/LI)'=>'列表 (UL/LI)','Ordinary List (OL/LI)'=>'普通列表 (OL/LI)','Use auto color cloud:'=>'使用自動顏色雲：','Font color mini: (default: #CCCCCC)'=>'字體顏色迷你：（預設：#CCCCCC）','Font color max: (default: #000000)'=>'字體顏色最大：（預設：#000000）','Tag link format:'=>'標籤連結格式：','Advanced usage:'=>'進階使用：','What to show'=>'顯示內容','PublishPress Taxonomies Logo'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies 標誌','Welcome to PublishPress Taxonomies, the WordPress taxonomy plugin'=>'歡迎來到 PublishPress Taxonomies，WordPress 稅onomy 插件','This screen allows you to enable or disable PublishPress Taxonomies features.'=>'此畫面允許您啟用或禁用 PublishPress Taxonomies 功能。','This feature allows you to create new taxonomies and edit all the settings for each taxonomy.'=>'此功能允許您創建新的 taxonomies 並編輯每個 taxonomy 的所有設置。','This feature allows you to search and edit all the terms on your site.'=>'此功能允許您搜索和編輯您網站上的所有術語。','This feature allows you to search for terms and see all the posts attached to that term.'=>'此功能允許您搜索術語並查看所有附加到該術語的文章。','Terms Display'=>'條款顯示','This feature allows you to create a customizable display of all the terms in one taxonomy.'=>'此功能允許您創建一個可自定義的顯示，顯示一個分類法中的所有術語。','Terms for Current Post'=>'當前文章的術語','This feature allows you create a customizable display of all the terms assigned to the current post.'=>'此功能允許您創建一個可自定義的顯示，顯示分配給當前文章的所有術語。','This feature creates a display of similar posts. If a post has the terms “WordPress” and “Website”, Related Posts will display other posts with those same terms.'=>'此功能會創建相似文章的顯示。如果一篇文章具有“WordPress”和“網站”的術語，相關文章將顯示其他具有相同術語的文章。','This feature automatically adds links to your chosen terms. If you have a term called “WordPress”, Auto Links finds the word “WordPress” in your content and add links to the archive page for that term.'=>'此功能會自動為您選擇的術語添加連結。如果您有一個名為“WordPress”的術語，自動連結會在您的內容中找到“WordPress”這個詞並為該術語的存檔頁面添加連結。','This feature allows you to quickly edit the terms attached to multiple posts at the same time.'=>'此功能允許您快速編輯附加到多篇文章的術語。','This feature allows you to add, rename, merge, and delete terms for any taxonomy.'=>'此功能允許您為任何稅onomy 添加、重命名、合併和刪除術語。','Show All Existing Terms'=>'顯示所有現有術語','Manage Post Terms'=>'管理帖子術語','Create Terms'=>'創建術語','This post type has no taxonomies.'=>'此文章類型沒有稅onomy。','%1s Metabox'=>'%1s Metabox','Enable the metabox on the %1s screen.'=>'在 %1s 畫面上啟用 metabox。','Metabox Features'=>'Metabox 功能','Show Private Taxonomies'=>'顯示私人稅onomy','Add support for private taxonomies.'=>'為私人稅onomy 添加支持。','Default Taxonomy'=>'預設稅onomy','%1s Metabox Filters'=>'%1s Metabox 篩選器','Enable filters in the %1s existing terms tab.'=>'在 %1s 現有術語標籤中啟用篩選器。','Default Method for choosing terms'=>'選擇術語的預設方法','Default Ordering for choosing terms'=>'選擇術語的預設排序','Default maximum terms'=>'選擇術語的預設最大數量','Metabox Show Term Post Count'=>'Metabox 顯示術語文章計數','Show Term Slug'=>'顯示術語別名','Minimum term length'=>'最小術語長度','Specify the minimum length for new terms when creating terms.'=>'指定創建術語時新術語的最小長度。','Maximum term length'=>'最大術語長度','Specify the maximum length for new terms when creating terms.'=>'指定創建術語時新術語的最大長度。','Prohibited Characters'=>'禁止字符','Enter characters that will be blocked when users add new terms inside the "Create Terms" box. For example: !@#$%&*()'=>'輸入用戶在“創建術語”框中添加新術語時將被阻止的字符。例如：!@#$%&*()','Allow users in the %1s role to use the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'允許 %1s 角色的用戶使用 PublishPress Taxonomies metabox。','Block Users from Creating New Terms'=>'阻止用戶創建新術語','Prevent users in the %1$s role from creating new terms in the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'防止 %1$s 角色的用戶在 PublishPress Taxonomies metabox 中創建新術語。','Taxonomies in Metabox'=>'Metabox中的分類法','Select the taxonomies that users in %1s role can manage in the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'選擇在%1s角色中可管理的PublishPress分類法Metabox。','Remove Default Metaboxes'=>'移除預設Metabox','Remove default taxonomy metaboxes for users in the %1s role.'=>'移除%1s角色用戶的預設分類法Metabox。','These settings control features on the Posts screen.'=>'這些設置控制文章螢幕上的功能。','Terms Filter display:'=>'術語過濾器顯示：','Term Name'=>'術語名稱','Term Name + Taxonomy Name'=>'術語名稱 + 分類法名稱','Term Name + Taxonomy Slug'=>'術語名稱 + 分類法別名','This controls the details that appear in the "Terms Filter" display and can help if you have terms with similar names.'=>'這控制在"術語過濾器"顯示中出現的詳細資訊，對於有相似名稱的術語會有所幫助。','Terms Filter taxonomy:'=>'術語過濾器分類法：','Public Taxonomies'=>'公共 taxonomies','Private Taxonomies'=>'私人 taxonomies','Public Taxonomies and Private Taxonomies'=>'公共分類法和私有分類法','This controls the taxonomy terms that appear on the "Posts" screen.'=>'這控制在"文章"螢幕上出現的分類法術語。','This feature allows you to connect terms. When the primary or secondary term is added to a post, the other term can be added also.'=>'此功能允許您連接術語。當主要或次要術語被添加到文章時，其他術語也可以被添加。','Linked Terms Type:'=>'連結術語類型：','2-way relationship. When the main term or secondary term are added to the post, other term will be added also.'=>'雙向關係。當主要術語或次要術語被添加到文章時，其他術語也會被添加。','Add the primary term, get the secondary term'=>'添加主要術語，獲取次要術語','Add the secondary term, get the primary term.'=>'添加次要術語，獲取主要術語。','Enable Taxonomies:'=>'啟用分類法：','This controls which taxonomies are available for the Linked Terms feature.'=>'這控制Linked Terms功能可用的分類法。','This feature allows you to have multiple words associated with a single term. If PublishPress Taxonomies scans your content and finds a synonym, it will act as if it has found the main term.'=>'此功能允許您將多個單字與單一術語關聯。如果PublishPress分類法掃描您的內容並找到同義詞，則它會像找到主要術語一樣行事。','This controls which taxonomies are available for the Term Synonyms feature.'=>'這控制可用於術語同義詞功能的分類法。','Enable Hidden Terms:'=>'啟用隱藏術語：','This feature will hide terms that are infrequently used. These terms will be visible inside the WordPress admin area, but not on the front of this site.'=>'此功能將隱藏不常使用的術語。這些術語將在WordPress管理區域中可見，但不會在此網站的前端顯示。','Minimum Usage for Hidden Terms:'=>'隱藏術語的最小使用量：','Set the minimum number of posts a term must be attached to. If you enter 5, any term used in fewer than 5 posts will be hidden across the site, and its archive page will redirect to the homepage.'=>'設置術語必須附加到的最小文章數量。如果您輸入5，則在少於5篇文章中使用的任何術語將在整個網站上隱藏，其存檔頁面將重定向到首頁。','PublishPress Taxonomies loads CSS and JavaScript files on the frontend for features like Terms Display, Related Posts, and Terms for Current Post. If you disable these scripts, those features may not display correctly.'=>'PublishPress分類法在前端加載CSS和JavaScript文件，以支持術語顯示、相關文章和當前文章的術語等功能。如果您禁用這些腳本，這些功能可能無法正確顯示。','Disable Frontend Scripts:'=>'禁用前端腳本：','Check this to prevent PublishPress Taxonomies from loading CSS and JavaScript files on the frontend of your site.'=>'檢查此選項以防止PublishPress分類法在您網站的前端加載CSS和JavaScript文件。','Disable Admin Preview Scripts:'=>'禁用管理預覽腳本：','Check this to prevent PublishPress Taxonomies from loading frontend CSS and JavaScript files in the WordPress admin area. This will break the preview functionality when editing Terms Display, Related Posts, and Terms for Current Post.'=>'檢查此選項以防止PublishPress分類法在WordPress管理區域中加載前端CSS和JavaScript文件。這將在編輯術語顯示、相關文章和當前文章的術語時破壞預覽功能。','These settings control features on the Manage Terms screen.'=>'這些設置控制管理術語螢幕上的功能。','Add Terms:'=>'添加術語：','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug while adding terms'=>'啟用此選項將允許用戶在添加術語時查看別名','Remove Terms:'=>'移除術語：','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug while removing terms'=>'啟用此選項將允許用戶在移除術語時查看別名','Rename Terms:'=>'重新命名術語：','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug while Renaming terms'=>'啟用此選項將允許用戶在重新命名術語時查看別名','Merge Terms:'=>'合併術語：','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug while merging terms'=>'啟用此選項將允許用戶在合併術語時查看別名','Mass Edit Terms:'=>'批量編輯術語：','Enabling this will allow users to see the slug in the Mass Edit Terms screen'=>'啟用此功能將允許用戶在批量編輯術語畫面中查看 slug','No tags for this post.'=>'此文章沒有標籤。','<a href="%post_permalink%" title="%post_title% (%post_date%)" style="font-size:%post_size%;color:%post_color%"> 
