			                       <img src="%post_thumb_url%" alt="%post_title%" height="200" width="200" class="custom-image-class" />
			                       </a> 
			                       (%post_comment%)'=>'<a href="%post_permalink%" title="%post_title% (%post_date%)" style="font-size:%post_size%;color:%post_color%"> 
			                       %post_title% <br> 
			                       <img src="%post_thumb_url%" alt="%post_title%" height="200" width="200" class="custom-image-class" />
			                       </a> 
			                       (%post_comment%)','<a href="%tag_link%" title="%tag_name_attribute%" class="st-post-tags t%tag_scale%" style="%tag_size% %tag_color%" %tag_rel%>%tag_name%</a>'=>'<a href="%tag_link%" title="%tag_name_attribute%" class="st-post-tags t%tag_scale%" style="%tag_size% %tag_color%" %tag_rel%>%tag_name%</a>','Shortcode entry successfully deleted.'=>'短碼條目已成功刪除。','Invalid post terms ID.'=>'無效的文章術語 ID。','Automatic display'=>'自動顯示','Shortcode'=>'Shortcode','Current Post'=>'當前文章','Add New Terms for Current Post'=>'為當前文章新增術語','Search Terms for Current Post'=>'搜尋當前文章的術語','Manage Terms for Current Post'=>'管理當前文章的術語','Preview Terms for Current Post'=>'預覽當前文章的術語','Toggle panel'=>'切換面板','Edit Terms for Current Post'=>'編輯當前文章的術語','Add new Terms for Current Post'=>'為當前文章新增術語','To create more Terms for Current Post, please upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro.'=>'要為當前文章創建更多術語，請升級到 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro。','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can create unlimited Terms for Current Post. You can create Terms for Current Post for any taxonomy and then display those Terms for Current Post anywhere on your site.'=>'使用 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro，您可以為當前文章創建無限制的術語。您可以為任何分類法創建當前文章的術語，然後在您的網站上任何地方顯示這些術語。','Choose Terms'=>'選擇術語','Display'=>'顯示','Layout'=>'佈局','Design'=>'設計','Display Format'=>'顯示格式','24 hours'=>'24 小時','7 days'=>'7 天','2 weeks'=>'2 週','1 month'=>'1 個月','6 months'=>'6 個月','1 year'=>'1 年','Limit terms based on timeframe'=>'根據時間範圍限制術語','Order direction'=>'排列方向','Font size minimum'=>'字體大小最小值','Font size maximum'=>'字體大小最大值','Point'=>'點','Percent'=>'百分比','Unit font size'=>'單位字體大小','Enable colors for terms'=>'啟用術語顏色','Font color minimum'=>'字體顏色最小值','This is the color of the least popular term.'=>'這是最不受歡迎的術語顏色。','Font color maximum'=>'字型顏色最大值','This is the color of the most popular term.'=>'這是最受歡迎的術語顏色。','Attempt to automatically display terms'=>'嘗試自動顯示術語','PublishPress Taxonomies will attempt to automatically display terms in this content. It may not be