.'=>'在前端和管理區域啟用此 taxonomy 的 PublishPress taxonomy 排序。','Re-activate Taxonomy'=>'重新啟用 taxonomy','Deactivate Taxonomy'=>'停用 taxonomy','Delete Taxonomy'=>'刪除 taxonomy','Delete PublishPress Taxonomies Edit Data'=>'刪除 PublishPress taxonomy 編輯數據','You can only delete taxonomies created with PublishPress Taxonomies. However, you can delete any changes or edit made from PublishPress Taxonomies which will remove PublishPress Taxonomies version edit restoring original taxonomies data or removing it if already deleted'=>'您只能刪除使用 PublishPress taxonomy 創建的 taxonomies。不過，您可以刪除任何來自 PublishPress taxonomy 的更改或編輯，這將恢復原始的 taxonomies 數據或在已刪除的情況下將其刪除。','Save Taxonomy'=>'保存 taxonomy','Add Taxonomy'=>'添加 taxonomy','Term copied successfully.'=>'術語複製成功。','Term deleted successfully.'=>'術語刪除成功。','Term removed from all posts successfully.'=>'術語成功從所有文章中移除。','Synonyms'=>'同義詞','Status'=>'狀態','Copy'=>'複製','Select Destination Taxonomy'=>'選擇目的地 taxonomy','Search posts'=>'搜尋文章','post type'=>'post type','Select Destination %s'=>'選擇目的地 %s','Terms deleted successfully.'=>'術語刪除成功。','Term(s) copied successfully.'=>'術語複製成功。','Hidden'=>'隱藏','Live'=>'顯示','No terms found.'=>'未找到術語。','Quick edit &#8220;%s&#8221; inline'=>'快速編輯 &#8220;%s&#8221; 內聯','Quick&nbsp;Edit'=>'快速編輯','Remove From All Posts'=>'從所有文章中移除','Quick Edit'=>'快速編輯','This screen allows you to search and edit all the terms on your site.'=>'此螢幕讓您搜尋和編輯您網站上的所有術語。','This screen allows you to order terms via drag and drop.'=>'此畫面允許您透過拖放來排序條目。','Search Terms'=>'搜尋條目','Media Tags'=>'媒體標籤','Media Tag'=>'媒體標籤','All Media Tags'=>'所有媒體標籤','Edit Media Tag'=>'編輯媒體標籤','View Media Tag'=>'查看媒體標籤','Update Media Tag name'=>'更新媒體標籤名稱','Add new Media Tag'=>'新增媒體標籤','New Media Tag name'=>'新媒體標籤名稱','Parent Media Tag'=>'父媒體標籤','Parent Media Tag:'=>'父媒體標籤：','Search Media Tags'=>'搜尋媒體標籤','Popular Media Tags'=>'熱門媒體標籤','Separate Media Tags with commas'=>'使用逗號分隔媒體標籤','Add or remove Media Tags'=>'新增或移除媒體標籤','Choose from the most used Media Tags'=>'從最常用的媒體標籤中選擇','No Media Tags found'=>'未找到媒體標籤','No Media Tags'=>'沒有媒體標籤','Media Tags list navigation'=>'媒體標籤列表導航','Media Tags list'=>'媒體標籤列表','Back to Media Tags'=>'返回媒體標籤','PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'PublishPress 稅onomies 日誌','Search PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'搜索 PublishPress 稅onomies 日誌','Edit PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'編輯 PublishPress 稅onomies 日誌','Update PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'更新 PublishPress 稅onomies 日誌','Add New PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'新增 PublishPress 稅onomies 日誌','New PublishPress Taxonomies Logs'=>'新的 PublishPress 稅onomies 日誌','You\'re using PublishPress Taxonomies Free. The Pro version has more features and support.'=>'您正在使用 PublishPress 稅onomies 免費版。專業版擁有更多功能和支持。','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'升級到 PublishPress 稅onomies 專業版','Enhance the power of PublishPress Taxonomies with the Pro version:'=>'使用專業版增強 PublishPress 稅onomies 的功能：','Unlimited “Term Display”'=>'無限制的「術語顯示」','Unlimited “Terms for Current Posts”'=>'無限制的「當前文章的術語」','Unlimited “Related Posts”'=>'無限制的「相關文章」','Unlimited “Auto Links”'=>'無限制的「自動鏈接」','Unlimited “Auto Terms”'=>'無限制的「自動術語」','Create new terms using OpenAI and other sources'=>'使用 OpenAI 和其他來源創建新術語','Use Linked Terms'=>'使用鏈接的術語','Use Synonyms'=>'使用同義詞','Schedule Auto Terms to run automatically'=>'安排自動術語自動運行','Control the display of term metaboxes'=>'控制術語元框的顯示','Fast, professional support'=>'快速、專業的支援','No ads inside the plugin'=>'插件內無廣告','Need PublishPress Taxonomies Support?'=>'需要 PublishPress taxonomies 支援嗎？','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'如果您需要幫助或有新的功能請求，請告訴我們。','Request Support'=>'請求支援','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'詳細的文件也可以在插件網站上找到。','View Knowledge Base'=>'查看知識庫','OpenAI Integration'=>'OpenAI 整合','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate OpenAI to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress taxonomies Pro 允許您整合 OpenAI 來分析您的內容並建議術語。','IBM Watson Integration'=>'IBM Watson 整合','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate Watson to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress taxonomies Pro 允許您整合 Watson 來分析您的內容並建議術語。','Dandelion Integration'=>'蒲公英整合','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate Dandelion to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress taxonomies Pro 允許您整合蒲公英來分析您的內容並建議術語。','LSEG / Refinitiv Integration'=>'LSEG / Refinitiv 整合','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to integrate LSEG / Refinitiv to analyze your content and suggest terms.'=>'PublishPress taxonomies Pro 允許您整合 LSEG / Refinitiv 來分析您的內容並建議術語。','Suggest terms using AI'=>'使用 AI 建議術語','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the OpenAI. This service can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress taxonomies Pro 允許您使用 OpenAI 為您的內容建議新術語。這項服務可以分析您的內容並建議新術語。','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the IBM Watson. This service can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress taxonomies Pro 允許您使用 IBM Watson 為您的內容建議新術語。這項服務可以分析您的內容並建議新術語。','Copy with Metadata'=>'複製帶有元數據','Auto Terms using AI Connectors'=>'使用 AI 連接器的自動術語','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro can generate terms using any compatible AI provider configured in Settings > Connectors.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 可以使用在設置 > 連接器中配置的任何兼容 AI 提供者生成術語。','Auto terms using AI'=>'使用 AI 自動生成術語','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to generate new terms for your content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. These services can analyze your content and add new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允許您使用 OpenAI、IBM Watson、Dandelion 和 Open Calais 服務為您的內容生成新術語。這些服務可以分析您的內容並添加新術語。','Additional taxonomies'=>'附加的分類法','Select additional taxonomies...'=>'選擇附加的分類法...','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro to generate separate terms for multiple taxonomies in one OpenAI request.'=>'升級到 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 以在一次 OpenAI 請求中為多個分類法生成單獨的術語。','Generate separate terms for multiple taxonomies in one OpenAI request.'=>'在一次 OpenAI 請求中為多個分類法生成單獨的術語。','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to suggest new terms for your content using the OpenAI, IBM Watson, Dandelion and Open Calais services. These services can analyze your content and suggest new terms.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允許您使用 OpenAI、IBM Watson、Dandelion 和 Open Calais 服務為您的內容建議新術語。這些服務可以分析您的內容並建議新術語。','Add Custom Elements'=>'添加自定義元素','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you complete control over where Auto Links are added. You can choose to skip any HTML elements that appear in your content.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允許您完全控制自動連結添加的位置。您可以選擇跳過出現在內容中的任何 HTML 元素。','Use Regular Expressions to modify Auto Terms'=>'使用正則表達式修改自動術語','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to change how Auto Terms analyzes your posts. You will need to know how to write Regular Expressions to use this feature.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允許您更改自動術語分析您的文章的方式。您需要知道如何編寫正則表達式才能使用此功能。','This feature allows you to connect terms. When the main term or any of these terms are added to the post, all the other terms will be added also.'=>'此功能允許您連接術語。當主要術語或這些術語中的任何一個被添加到文章時，所有其他術語也將被添加。','Linked Terms Feature'=>'連結術語功能','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to create powerful connections between your terms. When one term is added to a post, its linked terms can be automatically added too. This helps maintain consistent organization across your content.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允許您在術語之間創建強大的連結。當一個術語被添加到文章時，其連結術語也可以自動添加。這有助於在您的內容中維持一致的組織。','This feature allows you to associate additional words with each term. For example, "website" can have synonyms such as "websites", "web site", and "web pages".'=>'此功能允許您將額外的單詞與每個術語關聯。例如，“網站”可以有同義詞，如“網站”、“網頁”和“網頁”。','Synonyms Terms Feature'=>'同義詞術語功能','PublishPress Taxonomies Pro allows you to have multiple words associated with a single term. If PublishPress Taxonomies scans your content and finds a synonym, it will act as if it has found the main term.'=>'PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 允許您將多個單詞與單一術語關聯。如果 PublishPress Taxonomies 掃描您的內容並找到同義詞，它將視為找到了主要術語。','Taxonomy Display'=>'分類顯示','This feature is available in PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'此功能在 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 中可用','Customize the display of terms in the PublishPress Taxonomies metabox.'=>'自定義 PublishPress Taxonomies metabox 中術語的顯示。','Options include checkboxes and a dropdown list.'=>'選項包括複選框和下拉列表。','Copy Term with Metadata'=>'複製帶有元數據的術語','To Copy terms with their metadata, please upgrade to pro.'=>'要複製帶有其元數據的術語，請升級至專業版。','With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can duplicate taxonomy terms along with all their metadata. This includes term descriptions, images, and custom fields. You can copy terms between taxonomies to maintain consistent organization across your site.'=>'使用 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro，您可以重複分類術語及其所有元數據。這包括術語描述、圖像和自定義字段。您可以在分類之間複製術語，以維持網站內的一致組織。','Choose the display formats of your terms, options include table list, ordered list, border-cloud and lots more.'=>'選擇您術語的顯示格式，選項包括表格列表、有序列表、邊框雲和更多。','Hourly'=>'每小時','Daily'=>'每天','Pro Feature'=>'專業功能','Some of these features are available in PublishPress Taxonomies Pro'=>'這些功能中的一些在 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 中可用','ID'=>'ID','Name (Pro)'=>'名稱 (專業)','Counter (Pro)'=>'計數器 (專業)','Random (Pro)'=>'隨機 (專業)','Term Order (Pro)'=>'術語順序 (專業)','Order terms for display by'=>'按以下方式排列術語以顯示','Term Order'=>'術語順序','Disabled'=>'已禁用','You have disabled PublishPress Taxonomies ordering'=>'您已禁用 PublishPress Taxonomies 的排序','Terms in this taxonomy are ordered by %s'=>'此分類法中的術語按 %s 排序','Term Order(Pro)'=>'術語順序 (專業)','Upgrade to PublishPress Taxonomies Pro to use Term Order to manually order Terms'=>'升級到 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 以使用術語順序手動排序術語','The provider request was not sent.'=>'提供者請求未發送。','Result from api.'=>'來自 API 的結果。','Request completed.'=>'請求已完成。','Security error. Kindly reload this page and try again'=>'安全錯誤。請重新載入此頁面並重試','Permission error. You do not have permission to manage PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'權限錯誤。您沒有權限管理 PublishPress Taxonomies','Posts content and title is empty.'=>'文章內容和標題為空。','Permission error. You do not have permission to preview this post.'=>'權限錯誤。您沒有權限預覽此文章。','You do not have permission to manage this taxonomy. Enable Metabox Access Taxonomies for this role in %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.'=>'您沒有權限管理此 taxonomy。在 %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s 中為此角色啟用 Metabox Access Taxonomies。','Too many AI preview requests. Please wait a minute and try again.'=>'AI 預覽請求過多。請等候一分鐘後再試。','Term Results'=>'術語結果','No results found for this post with this taxonomy.'=>'此文章在此 taxonomy 中未找到結果。','Invalid Auto Term ID. Please save the settings before using preview.'=>'無效的自動術語 ID。請在使用預覽之前先保存設置。','You must enable at least one AI integration source to use auto term preview.'=>'您必須啟用至少一個 AI 整合來源才能使用自動術語預覽。','This Auto Terms option is not enabled for metaboxes. Please enable it in the Auto Terms settings.'=>'此自動術語選項未為 metaboxes 啟用。請在自動術語設置中啟用它。','Click %1s to select or deselect them from this %2s.'=>'點擊 %1s 以從此 %2s 中選擇或取消選擇它們。','Suggest Existing Terms'=>'建議現有術語','AI Connectors: %s'=>'AI 連接器：%s','Update %1s on this %2s'=>'在此 %2s 上更新 %1s','Existing Terms not found for the selected post type and taxonomies'=>'未找到所選文章類型和 taxonomies 的現有術語','Existing Terms taxonomy is required. Kindly select taxonomies and save the settings before running preview.'=>'需要現有術語 taxonomy。請選擇 taxonomies 並在運行預覽之前保存設置。','Result from ajax request.'=>'來自 ajax 請求的結果。','The selected taxonomy is not associated with the selected post type.'=>'所選的 taxonomy 與所選的 post type 沒有關聯。','No results found for this taxonomy.'=>'未找到此 taxonomy 的結果。','You do not have permission to edit this post.'=>'您沒有權限編輯此文章。','You do not have permission to assign terms from this taxonomy.'=>'您沒有權限從此 taxonomy 指派術語。','Click Term to select or deselect from this %1s'=>'點擊術語以從此 %1s 中選擇或取消選擇','Both Taxonomy and Post are required.'=>'必須同時選擇 taxonomy 和 post。','No new terms were selected or deselected.'=>'未選擇或取消選擇任何新術語。','%1s terms added to this %2s.'=>'%1s 術語已添加到此 %2s。','%1s terms removed from this %2s.'=>'%1s 術語已從此 %2s 移除。','You do not have capability to manage this taxonomy.'=>'您沒有管理此 taxonomy 的權限。','You do not have permission to edit this post with this taxonomy.'=>'您沒有權限編輯此含有 taxonomy 的文章。','Terms cannot contain the following characters: %s'=>'術語不能包含以下字元：%s','Terms must be at least %d characters long.'=>'術語必須至少有 %d 個字元長。','Terms cannot exceed %d characters.'=>'術語不能超過 %d 個字元。','The Dandelion integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'在 Legacy AI Sources 設定中已禁用 Dandelion 整合。','No matched result from the API Server.'=>'來自 API 伺服器的匹配結果為零。','The Dandelion integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'Dandelion 整合需要 API 金鑰。請在自動術語設定中添加您的 API 金鑰。','Selected content is empty.'=>'所選內容為空。','Result from cache.'=>'來自快取的結果。','API Error: %1s.'=>'API 錯誤：%1s。','Empty response.'=>'空響應。','Error establishing connection with the API server. Try again.'=>'與 API 伺服器建立連接時發生錯誤。請再試一次。','The LSEG / Refinitiv integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'LSEG / Refinitiv 整合在舊版 AI 來源設定中已被禁用。','The LSEG / Refinitiv integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'LSEG / Refinitiv 整合需要 API 金鑰。請在自動術語設定中添加您的 API 金鑰。','API Error: No matched result for content.'=>'API 錯誤：內容沒有匹配的結果。','The IBM Watson integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'IBM Watson 整合在舊版 AI 來源設定中已被禁用。','The IBM Watson integration requires an API Key and URL. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'IBM Watson 整合需要 API 金鑰和 URL。請在自動術語設定中添加您的 API 金鑰。','The IBM Watson API URL must use HTTPS and an official Natural Language Understanding service hostname.'=>'IBM Watson API URL 必須使用 HTTPS 和官方自然語言理解服務主機名稱。','No matched result from an AI Connector.'=>'來自 AI 連接器的結果不匹配。','AI Connectors require WordPress 7.0 or newer.'=>'AI 連接器需要 WordPress 7.0 或更新版本。','Invalid placeholder(s) detected: {%s}. Valid placeholders are: {content}, {post_terms}, {site_terms}'=>'檢測到無效的佔位符：{%s}。有效的佔位符有：{content}、{post_terms}、{site_terms}','You added {post_terms} in the prompt but your post does not contain any terms.'=>'您在提示中添加了 {post_terms}，但您的帖子不包含任何術語。','You added {site_terms} in the prompt but your site does not contain any terms for this taxonomy.'=>'您在提示中添加了 {site_terms}，但您的網站不包含此分類法的任何術語。','No compatible AI provider is configured. Install and configure a provider in Settings > Connectors.'=>'未配置兼容的 AI 提供者。在設置 > 連接器中安裝和配置提供者。','Result from an AI Connector.'=>'來自 AI 連接器的結果。','The direct OpenAI integration is disabled in the Legacy AI Sources settings.'=>'在 Legacy AI Sources 設置中禁用了直接的 OpenAI 集成。','The OpenAI integration requires an API Key. Please add your API Key in the Auto Term settings.'=>'OpenAI 整合需要 API 金鑰。請在自動術語設定中添加您的 API 金鑰。','Error: OpenAI says there is an issue with this API key. Please check your plan or billing details.'=>'錯誤：OpenAI 表示此 API 金鑰存在問題。請檢查您的計劃或計費詳細信息。','View Existing Terms'=>'查看現有術語','This feature allows you to browse all the terms in a taxonomy.'=>'此功能允許您瀏覽分類法中的所有術語。','View Current Post Terms'=>'查看當前文章的術語','This feature allows you to manage all the terms that are currently attached to a post.'=>'此功能允許您管理當前附加到文章的所有術語。','View Terms'=>'查看術語','This feature allows you to browse based on selected auto terms settings and sources.'=>'此功能允許您根據所選的自動術語設置和來源進行瀏覽。','Suggest Terms'=>'建議術語','Select all %1s'=>'選擇所有 %1s','Deselect all %1s'=>'取消選擇所有 %1s','Select %1s'=>'選擇 %1s','Please choose a post to use with PublishPress Taxonomies AI.'=>'請選擇一篇文章以用於 PublishPress Taxonomies AI。','Label can\'t be empty.'=>'標籤不能為空。','Label can\'t exceed 30 characters.'=>'標籤不能超過 30 個字符。','Unknown tab type.'=>'未知的標籤類型。','Error saving label.'=>'保存標籤時出錯。','Please choose a post to preview.'=>'請選擇一篇文章以預覽。','Metabox Settings'=>'Metabox 設置','This feature allows you to customize the metabox interface you see when adding terms to posts.'=>'此功能允許您自訂在添加術語到文章時所看到的 metabox 介面。','Save Changes'=>'保存更改','Select %s'=>'選擇 %s','Invalid request.'=>'無效的請求。','There\'s no content to scan.'=>'沒有內容可供掃描。','There are no terms that are relevant to your content.'=>'沒有與您的內容相關的術語。','This user does not have access to manage any of this post attached taxonomies. Enable Metabox Access Taxonomies for this role in %1sPublishPress Taxonomies Settings%2s.'=>'該用戶沒有權限管理任何與此貼文相關聯的分類。請在 %1s PublishPress Taxonomies 設定 %2s 中啟用此角色的 Metabox 存取分類。','No PublishPress Taxonomies Metabox features are enabled for this post type.'=>'此貼文類型未啟用任何 PublishPress Taxonomies Metabox 功能。','Rename tab'=>'重新命名標籤','Save, You can also press Enter to save and escape to cancel'=>'儲存，您也可以按 Enter 儲存並按 Esc 取消','Search existing terms'=>'搜尋現有術語','Search Terms...'=>'搜尋術語...','Create term'=>'創建術語','Create Term'=>'創建術語','You do not have the required capabilities to manage any of this post attached taxonomies.'=>'您沒有所需的能力來管理任何與此貼文相關的分類。','You can not edit this label.'=>'您無法編輯此標籤。','Invalid nonce token.'=>'無效的 nonce 令牌。','Label is too long.'=>'標籤太長。','Hey, you\'ve been using PublishPress Taxonomies for %s on your site. We hope the plugin has been useful. Please could you quickly leave a 5-star rating on WordPress.org? It really does help to keep PublishPress Taxonomies growing.'=>'嘿，您在您的網站上已經使用 PublishPress Taxonomies %s。我們希望此插件對您有幫助。請您能在 WordPress.org 上快速給予 5 顆星的評價嗎？這真的有助於保持 PublishPress Taxonomies 的成長。','1 week'=>'1 週','3 months'=>'3 個月','Click here to add your rating for PublishPress Taxonomies'=>'點擊這裡為 PublishPress taxonomy 評分','Maybe later'=>'也許稍後再說','I already did'=>'我已經評分了','This plugin can be deleted.'=>'此插件可以被刪除。','PublishPress Taxonomies was not activated because PublishPress Taxonomies Pro is already active. Please keep only PublishPress Taxonomies Pro enabled.'=>'PublishPress taxonomy 未被啟用，因為 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 已經啟用。請僅保留 PublishPress Taxonomies Pro 啟用。','term nameName'=>'名稱','term nameTaxonomy'=>'taxonomy']];